      "summary": "Shadow buffers and spotlight cones fail to render on modern GPUs",
      "details": "Pandora Tomorrow relies on legacy Direct3D 8 shadow buffer projection paths deprecated since GeForce 8000 / Radeon HD 2000 drivers, rendering critical stealth light/shadow gameplay broken without dgVoodoo 2.",
